<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel cut its rating for Venezuelan telephone company CANTV Friday to hold from long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The price of CANTV's American Depositary Receipt (ADR) has reached HSBC James Capel's March 1998 target price of $42.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Risk (remains) related to macroeconomic factors, tariff increases and labor reforms,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's ADR opened down 3/16 to 42-13/16 in New York.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
